--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/persistence-changes/2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status.zh.md
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+---
+description: "记录持久化类型更改及其兼容性确认。"
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status
+
+[English](2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status.md) | 中文
+
+## 概述
+
+为已结算的助手事件及其终止流元数据添加可选的供应商无关计费与模型状态快照。
+
+## 目录
+
+- [声明](#declaration)
+- [兼容性](#compatibility)
+- [验证](#verification)
+- [开发备注](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## 声明
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:assistant/attempt"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "45302a9dcf250b6fc3cb77f9ed1af8cd0ab9440c60a01a8b93e6b3f01888fd79"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "275630f738bf3c4375b8edea2c9cb710602bd2a5a11337eff7a8cd695181984f"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## 兼容性
+
+所有新增字段均为可选，因此现有 V4 记录仍然有效。旧版 V4 读取器会忽略额外的诊断字段；回放和模型可见消息派生均不依赖计费或状态。当前读取器会验证终止流元数据与顶层结算快照是否一致。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## 验证
+
+pnpm exec vitest run packages/llm/llm/tests/accounting.spec.ts packages/llm/llm/tests/status.spec.ts packages/llm/token-meter/tests/cost-projection.spec.ts packages/llm/token-meter/tests/turn-cost.spec.ts packages/session/session-persistence-jsonl/tests/generation.spec.ts：105 项测试通过。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## 开发备注
+
+无。
